Privacy Policy for TTip
Last Updated: May 15, 2026

1. Introduction
Welcome to TTip ("we," "our," or "us"). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use our mobile application TTip (the "App").

By using the App, you consent to the data practices described in this policy.

2. Information We Collect
Personal Information
Account Information: Email address, name, and phone number when you create an account

Payment Information: Transaction details for tips and payments (processed through our payment partners)

Biometric Data: Fingerprint or Face ID data for secure authentication (stored locally on your device only)

Usage Information
Transaction History: Tipping amounts, recipients, dates, and times

App Interactions: Features you use, time spent in app, and navigation patterns

Device Information
Device type, OS version, and unique device identifiers

Camera access: Used only for scanning QR codes to process tips

Notifications: Device tokens to send you payment confirmations and updates

3. How We Use Your Information
We use your information to:

Process and deliver tips to recipients

Authenticate your identity securely using biometrics

Send transaction confirmations and receipts

Improve app performance and user experience

Comply with legal and regulatory requirements

Detect and prevent fraud

4. Camera and Biometric Data
Camera: We only access your camera when you actively use the QR code scanner. No photos or videos are stored or uploaded to our servers.

Biometric Data: All biometric authentication happens locally on your device. We never receive, store, or have access to your fingerprint or Face ID data.

5. Data Sharing and Disclosure
We do not sell your personal information. We may share data with:

Recipient	Purpose
Payment Processors	To process tip transactions
Cloud Storage Providers	To securely store transaction data
Legal Authorities	When required by law
6. Data Security
We implement industry-standard security measures including:

End-to-end encryption for transaction data

Secure API authentication

Regular security audits

However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.

7. Data Retention
We retain your transaction history for as long as your account is active and for 7 years thereafter to comply with financial regulations. You may request deletion of your data by contacting us.

8. Your Rights
Depending on your location, you may have the right to:

Access your personal data

Correct inaccurate data

Request deletion of your data

Opt-out of marketing communications

9. Children's Privacy
The App is not intended for users under 13 years of age. We do not knowingly collect information from children under 13.

10. Changes to This Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new policy in the App and updating the "Last Updated" date.

